; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Impassable ring fully surrounding (-3, 5) -- every one of its 6 hex
; neighbors is authored impassable, so (-3, 5) itself is unreachable no
; matter which route HexPathfinder.find_path() attempts (mirrors
; tests/unit/core/geometry/test_hex_pathfinder.gd's own "fully-surrounded
; goal" criterion, driven here through the real EncounterTileAdapter-built
; Callables instead of a hand-written is_passable lambda).
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

